        "id": 94801,
        "name": "Amnachaidh",
        "username": "Amnachaidh",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-05T23:34:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><a href=\"http://appaddict.net/2014/01/31/handelabra-games-ios-port-of-sentinels-of-the-multiverse-is-now-slated-for-late-summer/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://appaddict.net/2014/01/31/handelabra-games-ios-port-of-sentinels-of-the-multiverse-is-now-slated-for-late-summer/</a><br><br>In my day, the cards were printed on thinner card stock, came without counters, and we settled rules disputes at dawn.&nbsp;  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> <br><br>I'm not really opposed with helper codes on the cards, so long as they don't detract from the overall art. They are crowded, though, so it may be a fairly large challege.</p>",
